  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut milk in a large pot over medium heat until warm and slightly thickened.",
    "Grate ginger and bruise lemongrass. ",
    "Add grated ginger, bruised lemongrass, and turmeric to the coconut milk. ",
    "Grate 1 teaspoon of nutmeg and add it to the coconut milk. ",
    "Add chicken breast to the pot and cook until browned on all sides and cooked through. ",
    "Add black peppercorns, garlic, and fish sauce to the pot. ",
    "Stir well to combine and cook for 1 minute. ",
    "Remove from heat and serve hot. ",
    "Season with additional nutmeg to taste.",
    "Add any desired fresh herbs, such as cilantro or scallions, for garnish."
